  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Programme Open Studio</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Open Studio is part of the Palestinian Red Crescent hospital and rehabilitation clinic El Amal-City, in Khan Younis, Gaza. In this after-school centre, children with and without a handicap participate in a variety of activities that stimulate curiosity and creativity. Expression through art, dance and sports helps the children cope with the realities of living in Gaza.</narrative>
  </description>
